verses.1:
For the choirmaster. According to Gittith. + 81:1 Gittith is probably a musical or liturgical term; here and in Psalms 8 and 84. Of Asaph.
 Sing for joy to God our strength;
 make a joyful noise to the God of Jacob.

verses.7:
You called out in distress, and I rescued you;
 I answered you from the cloud of thunder;
 I tested you at the waters of Meribah. + 81:7 Meribah means quarreling ; see Exodus 17:7|EXO 17:7 . 
 Selah
